1. DEFINITIONS
   "Software" means the source code, configuration, and assets in this
   repository (excluding third-party packages and any event-specific branding
   or images you add). "Local / Non-Commercial Use" means running the Software
   on your own machine or private network for learning, evaluation, or internal
   testing. "Single-Event Public Deployment" means publishing the Software on a
   public domain / the internet to run ONE (1) event. "Commercial / Multi-Event
   Use" means using the Software for more than one event, as part of a business,
   to generate revenue, as a hosted service for third parties, or to resell or
   redistribute it for a fee.

2. FREE FOR LOCAL / NON-COMMERCIAL USE
   You may freely use, copy, modify, and study the Software for Local /
   Non-Commercial Use, worldwide and at no cost.

3. FREE FOR A SINGLE PUBLIC EVENT (WITH ATTRIBUTION)
   You may deploy the Software publicly to run ONE (1) event at no cost,
   PROVIDED THAT a visible attribution "Supported by PT SRIWIJAYA UTAMA KARYA"
   (linked to https://sriwijayahost.id) remains displayed on the deployed site
   (for example, in the footer) and is not hidden, removed, or obscured.

4. BEYOND ONE EVENT / COMMERCIAL USE REQUIRES PERMISSION
   Any Commercial / Multi-Event Use requires prior permission and, where
   applicable, a separate agreement. To arrange this, contact:
      GitHub: https://github.com/hrmnpttr  (@hrmnpttr)

5. ATTRIBUTION
   a. The "Supported by PT SRIWIJAYA UTAMA KARYA" attribution and this license
      file must be retained in all copies and public deployments.
   b. You may add your own branding alongside — but must not remove or hide the
      PT SRIWIJAYA UTAMA KARYA attribution.
   c. Trademarks, logos, and event-specific branding/images are not covered by
      this license.

6. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTY & LIMITATION OF LIABILITY
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
   IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A
   PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.

   YOU USE THE SOFTWARE ENTIRELY AT YOUR OWN RISK. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT
